# the same-samples check (tools/same_samples.py): the pad's three kinds on the starting sound, the progression's
# steps at Snap 80 and Thickness 60: saws (the first kind), Wide saws (Preset 2's), Felt (Preset 8's). Not a test of
# its own.
notips
tap PLAY
wait 1500
tap HOME
kpage 1
turn K1 80
kpage 0
set 87 60
wait 600
padkind 0
wav pad-saws.wav
tapkey 0
wait 2500
tapkey 0
wait 2500
tapkey 0
wait 2500
tapkey 0
wait 2500
wavstop
padkind 1
wav pad-wide-saws.wav
tapkey 0
wait 2500
tapkey 0
wait 2500
tapkey 0
wait 2500
tapkey 0
wait 2500
wavstop
padkind 2
wav pad-felt.wav
tapkey 0
wait 2500
tapkey 0
wait 2500
tapkey 0
wait 2500
tapkey 0
wait 2500
shot pad-kinds.png
wavstop
